  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂\r\n準備はばっちりか？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　もちろんです！\r\n憧れのヒーロー役……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900311/2009003110020"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "しかもレッドだなんて！　えへへっ、プロデューサーさんが\r\nあたしにいろんなこと、教えてくれたおかげです！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900311/2009003110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ。果穂が誰よりもヒーローが好きで……\r\nその努力の結果、レッドを任せてもらえたんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……ありがとうございますっ！\r\nそれじゃあ、行ってきます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900311/2009003110040"
  },
  {
